the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over  till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thorns in a  song of ice and fire update video in  this video i want to show you something  else george rr martin had to say during  another recent interview now if you're  someone who watches all of my videos  then you're most likely already up to  date on everything george rr martin has  said as you know i often make videos  whenever he sits down for a new  interview or when he makes his own  updates on his not a blog website after  reading almost everything he's said over  the last few years i don't think i've  ever seen him say something like this  before during this new interview he  revealed some more information about how  he will end a song of ice and fire ever  since game of thrones ended over three  years ago millions of fans have wondered  if george rr martin's novels will have  the same ending as you can imagine there  are a lot of fans who are worried about  this because they hated how dan and dave  ended game of thrones now as i'm sure  most of you already know george rr  martin has said that the way he ends his  song of ice and fire novels will be very  different from the game of thrones  ending this is something that we've  actually heard him say before i think  most of us assume that this would happen  since game of thrones left out so many  characters from the novels there was  almost no way their endings would be the  same since they left out so much  information however there are still a  lot of fans who believe the major  moments we saw happen in game of thrones  season 8 are also going to happen at the  end of a song of ice and fire the main  reason why they believe this is because  game of thrones writers david and dan  said they got george r martin's ending  after having a sit down with him years  ago now although george rr martin has  said that he doesn't like to write his  endings in advance he's always known  what would happen with most of the main  characters when game of thrones writers  david and dan met with george in his  home years ago they found out some of  the major moments in his ending as of  right now none of us actually know what  they were given the only thing that has  been confirmed was that brainstark will  become the king actor isaac hemstead  wright revealed this shortly after the  game of thrones finale he said the  writers let him know this information  was directly from george rr martin  himself ever since game of thrones aired  its final season many of us fans have  wondered what else will be written in  the novels will we see daenerys  targaryen barn king's landing or arya  stark defeat a night king at the end of  a song of ice and fire this is what  every fan wants to know  did dan and dave actually get these  ideas from george well thanks to his  recent interview it doesn't really  matter where these ideas were from even  if he did give this information to david  and dan it no longer means we will see  it happen at the end of his story george  rr martin now says whatever he did give  the game of thrones writers will not  necessarily be in his novels anymore in  the new interview they ask him if his  upcoming novels will diverge from game  of thrones he said a lot of this story  comes to me as i write it i always knew  once the show got beyond my novels which  i honestly did not anticipate they would  start going in directions that my novels  are not going to go in now as i'm  writing a song of ice and fire and i'm  making more and more progress and it's  getting longer ideas are coming to me  and characters are taking me in  directions that are even further from  where the show went  so what i think you're gonna find is  when the winds of winter and then  hopefully a dream of spring come out  that my ending will be very different  and there will be some similarities some  big moments that i gave david and dan  many years ago when they visited me in  santa fe  that was the famous meeting i was  referring to earlier when david and dan  went to his home to find out how he  would end a song of ice and fire  now george is saying this meeting only  lasted for a few days therefore he  wasn't able to give them everything he  most likely hadn't thought of everything  either since this was nearly a decade  ago  now what he says next is very  interesting and significant if you ask  me he goes on to say even some of those  things i did give them are changing as i  do the writing so they will be different  and then it'll be up to the readers and  the viewers to decide which one they  like better and argue about it you see  most of us knew the ending would be  similar because he had been saying that  for years i think most of us did assume  that those major moments he gave david  and dan would stay the same but now he's  saying otherwise  now he says what he did give them will  be different as well i can't help but  wonder if the fan's backlash to game of  thrones season 8 had some sort of effect  on his writing although he has always  said the fans would not affect his  writing i do wonder if the hatred david  and dan received made him reconsider his  ending  something that previously  maybe one reader in a thousand would  have guessed but you still had the other  999 who would have no inkling  until you reveal it in a book  now  that one person in a thousand puts it on  an internet message board and everybody  sees it and they say oh yeah yeah that's  right now i see the clues i got it and  pretty soon  half  the readership or at least the internet  savvy portion of your readership knows  it but what do you do then do you change  it and come up with something goofy and  outlandish that you haven't led the you  haven't done the the foreshadowing for  that you haven't laid the foundation for  just in order to surprise people i mean  sure i could have like aliens come down  and that would certainly  surprise the out of everybody no one is  predicting that but  it would ruin the series so  he is definitely worried about how the  fans are starting to feel in the  interview he was also asked about the  backlash and his level of concern for  the new show he said i do see comments  online from fans and sometimes they  email me directly i'm also concerned  about a similar thing with my novel as  you know the winds of winter is very  very late the last one a dance with  dragons was 11 years ago and the fans  are very angry about that now since the  fans are already angry about how late it  is imagine if he releases the ones of  winner and it had a lot of the same dumb  ideas we saw in game of thrones imagine  waiting 11 years to see the exact same  thing we already saw on the show  i think that would make a lot of the  fans very upset even if it was  incredibly well written i think he saw  how the fans reacted to the final season  of game of thrones and ultimately  decided he better go in another  direction  regardless of what actually happened or  will happen we now know for a fact that  his ending will be very different even  those moments he gave david and dan all  those years ago  that makes me think something will be  very different with how danny jon arya  and even bran are handled but i guess we  shall see as always let me know what you  think down below i want to thank all of  you for stopping by and watching my  video i hope all of you have a great day  i will see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  you

